@startuml
title LINGORA - Context Data Flow Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle Learner
rectangle Admin

rectangle "LINGORA Web Learning System\n(includes internal GEC/T5-small processing)" as Lingora

Learner --> Lingora : credentials, answers, reviews, writing text
Lingora --> Learner : lessons, feedback, schedule, corrected text, progress
Admin --> Lingora : content, media, publish actions
Lingora --> Admin : validation and publication state

note bottom of Lingora
  Learner and Admin are the only external actors.
  GEC is internal processing, not an external actor.
end note
@enduml
